{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>אכפרה</b> — twice in the Masorah. The other: <i>אכפרה פניו במנחה</i> (I will appease His face at the afternoon offering). This is what they said: a person should always be careful with the afternoon prayer. <i>אכפרה בעד חטאתכם</i> — to pray on your behalf. When? <i>אכפרה פניו במנחה</i> — at the afternoon offering."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:58.115624564Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}